This directory contains vJunos-switch runtime configuration files.

Files in this directory:
- config: Runtime configuration for the vJunos-switch nested KVM switch
- image-config: Image paths set at build time (VJUNOS_QCOW2)
- juniper.conf: Optional Junos configuration file for initial switch config

The config file is populated by cloud-init user-data during instance boot.

Supported config variables:
  MGMT_INTERFACE       Host management interface (default: eth0)
  SWITCH_INTERFACE_START  First switch data interface (default: eth1)
  SWITCH_INTERFACE_COUNT  Number of switch data interfaces (default: 4)
  VJUNOS_RAM           RAM for the vJunos VM in MB (default: 5120)
  VJUNOS_VCPUS         vCPUs for the vJunos VM (default: 4)
  CONSOLE_PORT         Telnet console port (default: 8601)

Interface mapping:
  eth0  = Host management (CentOS, NM-managed, DHCP)
  eth1  = vJunos fxp0 (management, macvtap passthrough)
  eth2  = vJunos ge-0/0/0 (macvtap, trunk port)
  eth3+ = vJunos ge-0/0/1+ (macvtap, access ports)
